 "body_html": "<p>I have encountered &quot;still reachable&quot; and &quot;possibly lost&quot; leaks in valgrind from a lot of library code (OSX), but I haven't seen anything <strong>within</strong> a program that I have written that has that. For example, the following produces a &quot;definitely lost&quot; leak:</p>\n<pre><code>#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;\nint main(void)\n{\n    malloc(10)\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>What would be a code example of a <code>still-reachable</code> leak or a <code>possibly-lost</code> leak?</p>\n",
